# ─── Waitlist (Web3Forms) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The waitlist modal posts signups to Web3Forms, which emails them to the
# address on file for this access key. The KEY is a public routing token — it
# is safe to expose and does NOT reveal the destination email. The destination
# email is configured in the Web3Forms dashboard, never in this repo.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com, enter hornstein.magnus@gmail.com, get a key.
#   2. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the key below (.env.local is
#      gitignored, so it stays off the public repo).
#   3. For production, set the same variable in your host's env settings
#      (e.g. Vercel/Netlify project → Environment Variables).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
